              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हस्ताक्षर (hastākṣar) — \"a signature\", literally \"hand-letters\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हाथ and this word's हस्त- are the same old word for hand. यहाँ हस्ताक्षर (hastākṣar) कीजिए — \"please sign here\"."
            }
